{"3796750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glitch", "steam_appid": 3796750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling cyberpunk puzzle adventure where every second counts. Play as both a brilliant scientist racing to escape a malfunctioning security AI, and a loyal robot determined to scale the tower and rescue their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically swap between characters using teleporters to outwit the corrupted AI system before time runs out. Each character brings unique abilities to the table, and only by combining their strengths can you solve the ever-evolving puzzles and survive the deadly floors of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast, and clever enough to stay one step ahead of the Glitch?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling cyberpunk puzzle adventure where every second counts. Play as both a brilliant scientist racing to escape a malfunctioning security AI, and a loyal robot determined to scale the tower and rescue their creator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically swap between characters using teleporters to outwit the corrupted AI system before time runs out. Each character brings unique abilities to the table, and only by combining their strengths can you solve the ever-evolving puzzles and survive the deadly floors of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast, and clever enough to stay one step ahead of the Glitch?</p>", "short_description": "The AI Security has GLITCHED out! You must not get detected as you try to escape a security AI system that has gone rogue in this puzzle adventure. Use your two playable characters to solve puzzles and escape the building. Explore the mysterious facility, and don't get caught!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796750/31007dc4cc36315d631be4a29f338a